{
  "translate_en|mods/AnruisiTown/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/AnruisiTown.json|description": "AnruisiTown <LINE> <LINE> Anruisi Town is a small, militarized town.<LINE> Though it’s tiny, everyone here gets along in perfect harmony. <LINE> Now it’s home to a colorful mix of people. Life moves at a slow pace here, <LINE> but that doesn’t mean it’s dull or boring.<LINE> Because the town’s beautiful scenery will wrap you in a comfort like nothing you’ve ever felt before… ",
